# graphify corpus filters (gitignore syntax)
# https://github.com/safishamsi/graphify — detect() reads this at project root.
#
# Goal: keep django_apps + src architecture in graph.json for agents;
# drop generated assets and binary noise from Obsidian/wiki bloat.
#
# Granularity policy: docs/agent-workflows/graphify-routine.md § Granularity policy
# Default Level 1 = module/class/public API; do NOT graph every _private function.
# Level 2/3 = scoped rebuild on replay/solver packages when debugging contract paths.
#
# NOT ignored: **/__init__.py (lazy re-exports e.g. asteroid_lab layers matter)

# Django / Python build & test caches
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache/**
*.pyc

# DB migrations (schema history, not runtime architecture)
**/migrations/**

# Front-end vendored bundles and static game assets
**/vendor/**
django_apps/web/static/**

# Sprite / image corpus (hundreds of duplicate PNG nodes)
**/*.png
**/*.svg
**/*.jpg
**/*.webp
**/*.gif

# Test corpus — fixture builders add noise without architecture signal (Level 1)
tests/**

# graphify output (also hard-skipped in graphify; explicit here)
graphify-out/**

# After `graphify ... --obsidian`, run: scripts/graphify_obsidian_fixup.ps1
# (graphify always writes obsidian/graph.canvas; fixup moves it out of the vault)
